# UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer suppressions for scripts/e2e_guide_scenarios.py and
# scripts/e2e_persistence.py (#142).
#
# Each entry is a known, reported finding in code this e2e run does not change, kept as narrow
# as UBSan allows (one check in one function), so that every other report still fails CI.
# Remove an entry with the fix for its finding.
#
# There are none at the moment. The null member calls through the global pFrame from MyFrame's
# constructor (#168), in GuiderMultiStar::SetMultiStarMode, TargetWindow::TargetWindow,
# GuiderMultiStarConfigDialogCtrlSet, ScopeConfigDialogCtrlSet and Scope::SetMaxRaDuration,
# SetMaxDecDuration and SetDecGuideMode, were suppressed here until MyFrame's constructor set
# pFrame before building anything that uses it.
#
# The CI build still leaves out -fsanitize=vptr. Its first report is a different, pre-existing
# finding: EventServer::OnEventServerEvent (event_server.cpp) static_casts the wxSocketBase that
# wxSocketServer::Accept returns to wxSocketClient, which it is not, on every client connect.
# The check comes back with the fix for that.
